  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello!\n\nCurrently, you can hide avatars based on file size, performance, and proximity.\n\nWhen you hide avatars by performance it will show their fallback or imposter.\n\nWhen you hide by distance/count then it only shows grey diamonds. \n\nI would love an option to see fallback/imposters instead of diamonds!\n\nI really enjoy seeing as many avatars as possible, and the grey diamonds are not very immersive. It would be nice to show the closest ~10 full avatars, and have an option to have the rest of the people show as their fallback/imposters. It would make places feel more alive and full of people and you can still visually spot people from across the room.\n\nThanks!",
